  "html": "<table align=\"right\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left; background:rgb(240,240,240); border:1px solid black; width:25%;\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#9999FF; font-size:150%;\"> Butcher\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Butcher.png\" title=\"Image:Butcher.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Butcher.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Butcher.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Skill Type: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Offensive\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Trainer: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Fighter\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Number of Ranks: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">20\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Cost to Max: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">1124750\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">Damage and Increases Attack Rating, chance to knock down.\n</td></tr></table>\n<p><b>Butcher</b> is a savage melee attack that adds to your attack rating and deals a percentage of your normal melee damage to your target with a chance to knock them down.<br/>\nThis skill requires a melee weapon.\n</p><p><b>Cool down:</b> weapon based.\n</p><p><b>Tip</b>: <i>This power is a good power to put as your left/right click skill in your skill tray!</i>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><b>Adds X % to your Attack Rating and deals Y % of your normal Melee Weapon Damage.</b>\n</p>\n<table align=\"right\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center; width:100%; background:rgb(240,240,240);\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">Skill Level\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\"